00110001 11000000 # instruction | XOR AX,AX | Prepare segment zero.
10001110 11010000 # instruction | MOV SS,AX | Set the stack segment before its pointer.
10001110 11011000 # instruction | MOV DS,AX | Use physical log offsets.
10111100 00000000 01111100 # instruction | MOV SP,7C00 | Establish the stack below the source.
11111100 # instruction | CLD | Make DF zero in every sampled flag word.
10111000 11111111 11111111 # instruction | MOV AX,FFFF | Unsigned maximum.
10111011 00000001 00000000 # instruction | MOV BX,1 | Add one.
00000001 11011000 # instruction | ADD AX,BX | Carry with a zero result.
10100011 00000000 00100010 # instruction | MOV [2200],AX | Preserve the arithmetic result without changing flags.
10011100 # instruction | PUSHF | Save all native flags immediately after ADD.
01011010 # instruction | POP DX | Restore SP and retrieve that native word.
10001001 00010110 00000010 00100010 # instruction | MOV [2202],DX | Store the sampled flags.
10111001 11111111 01111111 # instruction | MOV CX,7FFF | Signed positive maximum.
