10001001 00110110 00001100 00100010 # instruction | MOV [220C],SI | Store 0010.
10011100 # instruction | PUSHF | Capture status after the register ADD.
01011000 # instruction | POP AX | Balance the stack.
10100011 00001110 00100010 # instruction | MOV [220E],AX | Store native flags.
