10001001 00101110 00010000 00100010 # instruction | MOV [2210],BP | Store 8000.
10011100 # instruction | PUSHF | Capture overflow and sign.
01011000 # instruction | POP AX | Retrieve the flags.
10100011 00010010 00100010 # instruction | MOV [2212],AX | Store flags.
10111100 11111110 00111111 # instruction | MOV SP,3FFE | A controlled stack-register operand; no call is active.
