10111100 00000000 01111100 # instruction | MOV SP,7C00 | Restore the original initialized pointer.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Native QMP reads the six result/flag pairs here.
11101011 11111101 # instruction | JMP -3 | Return to HLT if resumed.
